// settings modal (mirrors EscMenu.OpenSettings); CREDITS opens a small inline
// modal; QUIT closes the game (mirrors EscMenu/EndGame's Game.Close()). Also
// shows a compact Top-N leaderboard to the left of the menu column. Self-
// contained inline @code, no code-behind partial - mirrors EscMenu/BarMenu so
// there's no cross-file Rider codebehind-resolution trap to worry about.
